e anything on Florentyna in my notes?\", \"Oh good, that's the one. Can you make me a task to send the ask note so I actually remember to do it?\", \"Brilliant, and what about Bushra? I'm fairly sure I jotted something down there too.\", \"Nice. And what about Vreloness, while we're at it? I might have written something there as well.\", \"Last one, I promise — what about Elodie?\"], [\"umm is there anything about Florentyna in my notes?\", \"oh ok, can you add a task to, uh, send the ask note?\", \"and what about Bushra?\", \"hmm ok, what about Vreloness?\", \"and, um, what about Elodie?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0006\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you delete the buttercup photo?\", \"oh and, uh, who's coming to the apiary sale?\", \"ok, can you make a task to, uh, email Reddy tuesday?\", \"and when's... when's their birthday again?\"], [\"delete the buttercup photo pls\", \"who's comin to the apiary sale\", \"add a task to email Reddy tuesday\", \"when's their bday\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0007\", \"v\": [[\"My phone keeps saying storage is full, so I'm clearing things out — could you delete the wicker photo for me?\", \"Hm, okay. Different thing — I want to flick through the trip shots, can you show me the pics in the Mompox 2025 album?\", \"That fifth one's a dud, honestly, so could you get rid of the fifth one?\", \"Also, I've been practising a bit lately and might have written stuff down — do I have any tabla notes anywhere?\"], [\"delete the wicker photo\", \"show me pics in the Mompox 2025 album\", \"bin the fifth one\", \"oh do i have any tabla notes\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0008\", \"v\": [[\"get rid of every ideas note pls\"], [\"bin every ideas note\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0009\", \"v\": [[\"My camera roll is a total mess and I can't find anything, so what's the most recent picture I've taken?\", \"Okay, switching gears, I'm trying to get my week in order — what do I still have to get done tuesday?\"], [\"Could you tell me what the most recent photo I took is, please?\", \"Thank you. Would you also let me know what I still need to get done tuesday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0010\", \"v\": [[\"Could you log it under Grindeth, please? I texted them.\"], [\"log it for Grindeth, i texted them\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w28-0011\", \"v\": [[\"can u log for Arnel Yamada, messaged them today\"], [\"I've been rubbish at keeping in touch lately, so just for the record, can you log for Arnel Yamada that I messaged them today?\"]]}","ttft_ms":30528,"type":"result","duration_ms":43220,"uuid":"7c11bb97-1c1c-40a7-9d08-717bd8a46b6d","ttft_stream_ms":1503,"time_to_request_ms":188,"first_content_frame_ms":1504,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22358871,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278909377.7773,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
